                        The end points should be given in ``AXISNAME_end``.
        @depends_on = .  [OPTIONAL]
        @transformation_type = translation  [OPTIONAL]
        @units = pixels  [UNIT: NX_TRANSFORMATION]
        @vector = [1. 0. 0.]  [OPTIONAL]
      FIELD /entry/registration/tranformations/trans_y  shape=()  dtype=float64
        Value     : 55.0
        Concept   : NXtransformations/ENTRY/REGISTRATION/TRANSFORMATIONS/AXISNAME  [OPTIONAL]
        Inheritance:
          NXtransformations/AXISNAME
            Doc       : Units need to be appropriate for translation or rotation The name of this
